@startuml
title Pre-order Business Consultation and Validation Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "Customer Service Representative" as CSR
participant "Resource\nQualification" as ResourceQual
participant "CRM System" as CRM
participant "Product Order\nCapture &\nValidation" as OrderCapture

== Pre-Order Business Consultation & Validation ==

note over User
  Network Requirements:
  User demand descriptions or feedback.
  * Bank Manager: "I need a stable and reliable network connection to my private cloud."
  * Startup: "I need a network connection to a foreign AWS cloud server."
end note

User -> CSR : 1 Submit network requirements
CSR -> ResourceQual : 2 Query Resource Qualification
ResourceQual --> CSR : 3 Return Resource Availability Results
CSR -> User : 4 Provide feedback on Product status,\nconfirm if willing to wait for fulfillment?

alt Cannot accept the wait or conditions are unsuitable
User -> User : 5 Leave / Abandon
end

User -> CSR : 6 Confirm product order activation
CSR -> CRM : 7 Process in CRM System
CRM -> OrderCapture : 8 TMF663 Shopping Cart Management API\nPOST /shoppingCart
CRM --> CSR : 9 Return Status: Accepted, activation in progress
CSR -> User : 10 Notify user that activation is in progress
@enduml
